    "body": "The prior Prefix objective trained only the leading fragment of an incomplete word. This changes offline credit to three ordered conditional phases plus the original references, using the same 960 Prefix coefficients and native serving operators. One fresh twenty-backward aggregate drives one frozen adjacent-Q4 pass, with all 380 original correct-prefix decisions guarded on every accepted move.\n\nThe exported model emits the complete word in actual autoregressive output and retains all eight original complete replies with EOS. The longer reply still diverges at the following position and never reaches EOS within 32 tokens, so the candidate remains unselected. This is bounded learning progress and a retained complete-answer negative, with no serving exceptions, general language or geometry-advantage claim.\n\nSource58bd measured one fresh20 gradient,403 accepted/155 rejected/402 zero-gradient coordinates, all3 phase winners,17 references and380 guards, and383 native reloads. Combined CE5.020071718491739→3.016548696676182; word CE4.610984627348974→2.800196179500142. The immediate actual9 check is negative for the longer reply. Independent saved arithmetic PASS:26060 full pools and782 snapshot validations; no encoder/autodiff/AR replication claimed. Actual Rust complete-file verification and private preservation with fresh SHA verification bind source, binary, configuration, data, artifacts and reviews.\n\nValidation at exact final head e90265f4786234eeeeb83262566247ee27c9fb0e:91 training-example and16 core-example tests PASS, both release builds PASS, formatting of all four changed Rust files PASS, claim wording and diff checks PASS. Exact-head self-review PASS e8618d2849c59fa278d87a7b6aa7cae9703e5729914a42e6ff50d2038ec13a0a, with retained independent source, mathematical, adversarial and saved-arithmetic reviews. Actual execution stays bound to source58bd/binary62e/config6e5b; four final source blobs match that measurement, with no repeated model experiment. Final exact-head source/checks/review/executables are being privately preserved before queue admission. Historical compatibility statuses are transport acknowledgements only.\n\nReferences #820.",
